  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of the mid-point of the line segment joining the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the points on the ellipse <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;is an ellipse with eccentricity"
  },
  "options": [
    {
