  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0051_182bbe238fd1.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 49px;\" /></p><p>Let coordinate of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Equation&#160;</mtext><msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext>equation&#160;</mtext><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, then we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math> Required eccentricity is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
